# LF everywhere, enforced here rather than by each contributor's core.autocrlf.
#
# A CRLF shell script does not misbehave — it fails to start at all. The shebang line
# ends up naming an interpreter with a carriage return on the end of it, and no such
# interpreter exists. Every *.sh here is invoked by the plugin at runtime, so this is a
# correctness setting, not a tidiness one.
* text=auto eol=lf
